# Write Policy

Any model may modify this workspace **if every write clears the gates** in
[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) → "Write-quality gates":

1. **Quality** ≥ workspace standard (no stubs/TODOs/unfilled tokens; established structure + voice).
2. **Intent integrity** — no silent data/context/intent loss.
3. **Cross-link continuity** — update related files; regenerate; validate.
4. **No zombies** — archive + regenerate + repoint; never leave superseded stubs.

Before commit:

```
python3 09-tools/build-related.py
python3 09-tools/build-registry.py
python3 09-tools/build-trigger-routes.py
python3 09-tools/evaluate-skill-routing.py
python3 09-tools/validate-integrity.py
python3 09-tools/validate-links.py
python3 09-tools/validate-workspace.py
```

(`build-registry` after `build-related` — registry hashes SKILL.md bodies that related rewrites.)
